<title>FRANCE: EU sets daily wheat export refund for Switzerland.</title>
<headline>EU sets daily wheat export refund for Switzerland.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thurday set a daily refund of six Ecus per tonne on exports of EU soft wheat to Switzerland, Liechstenstein and the Spanish territory of Ceuta, France's grain office ONIC said</p>
<p>The EU's cereals management committee in Brussels also agreed a daily refund of 21.50 Ecus per tonne would apply to exports of EU barley and rye to these destinations.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
